(text "STACKUP / REVIEW\nF.Cu signals / In1.Cu GND / In2.Cu GND / B.Cu signals. Confirm the nominal stackup with the fabricator.\n0.0.11-dev adds eight factory service points and four independent M2.5 bracket anchors.\nERC / DRC are software checks. Module fit, powered operation and supplier assembly remain unqualified." (at 22.86 153.67 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1) ) (justify left)) (uuid "ef6b0108-df8c-5bdb-a42f-fef28cec288f"))
